body:
FINAL C1 CONSENSUS SYNTHESIS — finite portable movie foundation. This supersedes post-01M19N9SG3Q03VDPDRB1CR5Z25 and incorporates all three concrete AMEND reviews plus the independent ACCEPT-AS-AMENDED verdict.

## Gate and sequence

accepted exact D2 V8 + accepted B0-C specification with exact provider-free oracle identity
  -> C1-T documentation/type court

accepted C1-T + P1 closure + aggregate B0 closure
  -> C1-A -> C1-B -> C1-C -> C1-D -> C1-E -> C1-F

Only C1-F, with all child courts and the B0-C oracle evidence passing, closes aggregate C1. C1-T is the only next C1 bead to promote, and only after its two incoming documentation gates. No production edit begins at C1-T.

## C1-T finite exit artifact

One exact public type inventory and one closed requirement matrix freeze:

- local manifest keys; source, edition, stream, rendition, axis, occurrence, epoch, mapping-relation, derivation-receipt, bundle and atlas identities;
- SourceManifest[UnresolvedMappings] versus checked SourceBundle, with no conversion before all referenced canonical relations validate;
- normalized exact rational, axis witness plus runtime identity, signed coordinate, instant, strictly positive media interval, single-axis interval set, origin and extent;
- native packet timestamp envelope, operation/field provenance, independent PTS/DTS missingness, positive-or-unknown duration, and every D2 refusal;
- ClockRepair, TrackComposition and evidential EditionCorrespondence as separate families;
- total forward/reverse projection outcomes: Exact, Quantized, Enclosing, Gap, OutsideDomain, NoCorrespondence, Ambiguous and Refused;
- nonempty heterogeneous EvidenceSupport with explicit axis selection and no generic mixed-axis geometry;
- separate stream capability, reader coverage and boundary-provider search coverage algebras;
- separate shot existence/localization, morphology/extent, coded-scene, narrative-event, visual-rhyme and search-coverage payloads;
- minimal NarrativeSourceAtlas membership, lookup and support laws;
- exact SurfaceAtlas/TranscriptAtlas in-memory conformance domain, including the foreign-SpanRef-unit decision and absent/nonempty/legacy-empty AudioSpan cases;
- the exact B0-C oracle identity and a row binding every relevant oracle case to a type, constructor, lawful result or refusal, mutation and platform law;
- canonical fingerprint field order using full checksums, never runtime hashCode/toString/map order or truncated identities;
- explicit exclusions listed below.

For every public checked/non-Cartesian type the matrix enumerates every public/package-visible factory including unsafe-named paths, apply, copy, companion fromProduct and Mirror.ProductOf.fromProduct. Every refused mechanism has its own same-mechanism positive control. Honest Cartesian records may explicitly leave a door open; invariant-bearing values must close it or route through checked construction.

## C1-A — source primitives and exact axis kernel

Owns final stream/axis identities, stream manifests, edition and rendition primitives, exact rational arithmetic, typed axes/coordinates/instants/positive intervals/interval sets, and SourceManifest[UnresolvedMappings] with local mapping keys.

A does not construct checked SourceBundle, final BundleId or final EditionId. The unresolved manifest cannot become resolved source evidence. This avoids hashing unvalidated mapping references and avoids a BundleId/AxisId/MappingId cycle.

## C1-B — native timestamp envelope

Owns independent present-or-missing PTS and DTS, original fields, operation provenance, exact timebase, positive-or-unknown duration and D2 refusals:

- packet sentinel INT64_MIN -> missing before coordinate construction;
- rescale INT64_MIN -> arithmetic refusal;
- PASS_MINMAX cannot launder sentinel missingness;
- both-present PTS below DTS -> source-contract refusal preserving originals, with no swap/clamp/relabel/reorder/discard;
- DTS never becomes presentation evidence;
- duration zero -> unknown, negative duration refuses, negative timestamps remain lawful.

## C1-C — shared projection algebra and ClockRepair

Owns the total projection outcomes above and all shared mapping laws: directed source/target axes and roles, mapping family, canonical relation identity versus derivation receipt, occurrence, epoch/discontinuity seams, endpoints, canonical coalescing, exact rational arithmetic, declared quantization/rounding/residual, overflow refusal, no invented half-open coverage, reverse preimages, and composition that preserves gaps. ClockRepair monotonicity is only within a declared epoch.

C must pass the exact B0-C provider-free timestamp/mapping oracle on JVM, JS and Native.

## C1-D — composition, correspondence and bundle finalization

Adds TrackComposition-specific ordered/repeated/reordered ranges, holds, gaps, occurrences and set-valued reverse; adds EditionCorrespondence as evidential, partial, possibly many-to-many/nonmonotone, with no coordinate cast.

D resolves every local mapping reference through checked canonical relations, then and only then constructs SourceBundle and final BundleId/EditionId from the complete canonically ordered manifest. Changing direction, family, relation, gap, hold, occurrence, epoch, seam, endpoint, rendition or checksum changes identity or refuses.

## C1-E — evidence, capability, coverage and boundaries

Owns nonempty EvidenceSupport plus three non-convertible operational algebras:

1. stream capability: Decoded | PacketIndexedOnly | Unsupported;
2. reader coverage: DecodedSupport | PacketOnlySupport | UnsupportedByReader | NoCorrespondingSample | ProcessingFailure | ReaderUnexamined;
3. boundary-provider coverage: examined | failed | abstained | unexamined | ineligible, with candidate versus ExaminedNoCandidate separate.

Mandatory mutations prove: Unsupported is not Unexamined; NoCorrespondingSample is not Gap, OutsideDomain or NoCorrespondence; and empty partial/failed/abstained/ineligible/unexamined provider coverage cannot construct ExaminedNoCandidate.

E also owns the separate boundary payload families and lawful morphology/extent pairs: hard cut uses an instant; gradual transition uses a positive interval; no boundary layer constructs or entails another; no accepted epistemic status exists here.

## C1-F — shared atlas and legacy conformance

Owns checked semantic-free NarrativeSourceAtlas plus additive in-memory projection/retraction for StorySource/SurfaceAtlas and TranscriptAtlas. Exact text, UTF-16 support, units, order, lookup, speakers, roles, phases, prompts and traversal survive. None, nonempty AudioSpan, explicit legacy-empty, unknown duration and refusal remain distinct. Unbound audio cannot become media support; exact local 1/1000 binding preserves endpoints but cannot invent edition playback use.

## Common child court

Every child lands with its own JVM/JS/Native laws, full-checksum fingerprint mutations, B0-C matrix rows applicable to its types, and outside-package construction probes. Laws are not deferred to F and a later child cannot retroactively legalize an earlier invalid value.

## Exclusions and authority boundary

No rights/admission/access state, locator, credential, source fetch, media bytes, FFmpeg, decoder, pixel buffer, generator/validator, PySceneDetect/OpenCV, provider/model, feature extraction, codec/wire migration, compiler integration, accepted claim, narrative inference or movie-to-recall run belongs to C1. D0 remains the first exact source reader. F0 runtime realization follows the portable contract and cannot rewrite it.

Review provenance: AMEND posts post-01M19P0B6VMDGPQJ4AWZFN53EN, post-01M19P1QZ77N1JQE5QGS0YB2F7 and post-01M19P429R3RJDD59E3WGVJTBJ were accepted in post-01M19P1WPXT9Q0MQ5Q4T1Z01SY, post-01M19P2STZQF19Q6JT09PMFRZ0 and post-01M19P5EMGP7R32D9WFGRBG2Y6; independent collab verdict post-01M19P3ZTSK74FPN5VJS4609CQ is ACCEPT AS AMENDED.

Reviewers: CONFIRM or name one contradiction introduced by this synthesis. Chief: after confirmation, promote only C1-T with dependencies on exact D2 and B0-C; do not open C1-A until P1 and aggregate B0 close.
